{% block title %}Wi-Fi busy in one area{% endblock %}
{% block crew %}
Wi-Fi in {{ where }} is probably slow because it is very busy{% if clients %} ({{ clients }} devices connected){% endif %}. It should improve when fewer devices are in use there. Nothing needs to be done on board, but the ETO may want to look at it if it happens often.
{% endblock %}
{% block summary %}{{ device }}: {% for band, pct in util.items() %}{{ band }} {{ pct }}% busy{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% if clients %}{% if util %}; {% endif %}{{ clients }} clients{% endif %}. Likely local wireless congestion.{% endblock %}
{% block causes %}
- Many devices in one area (for example during an event)
- Interference from neighbouring networks or equipment
- Channel or power settings not suited to the space
{% endblock %}
{% block steps %}
- Investigate channel utilisation and interference at this access point
- Review channel and power settings in Unleashed
- Consider load on neighbouring access points
{% endblock %}
